    <h1>Are Nonstop Flights Worth the Extra Cost?</h1>
    <p>The price premium for flying nonstop is real but often smaller — and more variable — than travelers expect. Here is how to decide when it makes sense to pay it.</p>
    <div class="stat-strip">
